<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Higher up where light increases,</l><l>Far above all earthly strife,</l><l>Where the strain of effort ceases,</l><l>Where in Christ we reign in Life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Savior, keep me up the mountain</l><l>Pressing on toward the goal,</l><l>Till, as one, we share Thine image,</l><l>And Thy love and grace extol.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
